# Jeuno section 1 at Port Bastok: Argus' own script plays the gate guards' mission list 1001; its finish with option 0
# does nothing, with option 12 begins the mission and says YOU_ACCEPT_THE_MISSION; then the mission's 1002.
lists BastokMarkets/Cleades/onTrigger BastokMarkets/onEventFinish/1001 BastokMines/Rashid/onTrigger BastokMines/onEventFinish/1001 Metalworks/Lucius/onTrigger Metalworks/Malduc/onTrigger Metalworks/onEventFinish/322 Metalworks/onEventFinish/1001 PortBastok/Argus/onTrigger PortBastok/onEventFinish/1001 RuludeGardens/_6r2/onTrigger RuludeGardens/Goggehn/onTrigger RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/38 RuludeGardens/onEventFinish/41 LowerDelkfuttsTower/_542/onTrade LowerDelkfuttsTower/_542/onTrigger LowerDelkfuttsTower/onEventFinish/1
char zone=PortBastok pos=132,8.5,-4 job=WAR lvl=30 nation=1
mission Rov Resonance current
mission Bastok TheZeruhnReport completed
mission Bastok GeologicalSurvey completed
mission Bastok Fetichism completed
mission Bastok TheCrystalLine completed
mission Bastok WadingBeasts completed
mission Bastok TheEmissary completed
mission Bastok TheFourMusketeers completed
mission Bastok ToTheForsakenMines completed
login
trigger Argus                            # section 1: 1001
finish option=0                         # not 12: nothing
trigger Argus
finish option=12                        # begun
trigger Argus                            # 1002
finish-if-event
